=== Working ===
  * Serial
  * Ethernet: still requires either booting from self-made U-Boot or forcing the vendor U-Boot to initialize the switch (e.g. tftp ...)
  * USB (tested)
  * WiFi: doesn't work when booting from self-made U-Boot yet. works perfectly with rt2x00 when booting the vendor U-Boot, WiFi-routing performance is currently hitting the bottle-neck in the Ethernet driver:

eth0: tx ring full

=== Not working yet ===
  * ADSL: driver loads, never gets past 0x300 handshake
  * TAPI/VoIP: reference drivers probed ok, however, since a Si3220 dual-SLIC is used, we'll need a driver for that and working SPI support...

